{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-012","slides":[{"text":"the homework could wait."},{"text":"vegeta couldn't."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-013","slides":[{"text":"someone at cartoon network decided"},{"text":"that a block of japanese animation"},{"text":"needed a host who was a small robot"},{"text":"living alone on a spaceship called the absolution"},{"text":"with an AI named sara"},{"text":"and that this robot should speak"},{"text":"like a cool older brother who believed in you."},{"text":"they were right."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-014","slides":[{"text":"toonami treated a 4 pm timeslot"},{"text":"like prime time."},{"text":"for its audience, it was."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-015","slides":[{"text":"the ocean dub changed the names."},{"text":"changed the plot."},{"text":"changed the music."},{"text":"sent dead characters to \"another dimension.\""},{"text":"didn't matter. still watched."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-016","slides":[{"text":"you could not explain gundam wing to an adult."},{"text":"you could barely explain it to yourself."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-017","slides":[{"text":"tom got destroyed in a toonami event"},{"text":"and it felt like losing someone real."},{"text":"he was cgi on a cable network."},{"text":"didn't matter."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-018","slides":[{"text":"five episodes for one fight."},{"text":"nobody ever changed the channel."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-019","slides":[{"text":"toonami's promo for evangelion"},{"text":"made you think you were ready."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-020","slides":[{"text":"the absolution was a better set"},{"text":"than most actual tv shows had."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-021","slides":[{"text":"every kid in america learned the kamehameha pose"},{"text":"from the same broadcast."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-022","slides":[{"text":"these tapes have commercials for toys"},{"text":"that don't exist anymore"},{"text":"from companies that don't exist anymore"},{"text":"voiced by actors who sounded like they'd been awake for thirty hours"},{"text":"selling happiness at $19.99 plus shipping and handling"},{"text":"aired during shows that changed your life."},{"text":"the commercials might have changed it more."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-023","slides":[{"text":"the tracking lines on these recordings"},{"text":"are from somebody pressing record at 4 pm"},{"text":"every single weekday"},{"text":"on the same tape they used last week"},{"text":"recorded over whatever their parents had on there."},{"text":"some of those tapes had wedding footage."},{"text":"toonami was more important."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-024","slides":[{"text":"toonami played a broken blade speech"},{"text":"over anime footage"},{"text":"and an entire generation decided never to give up."},{"text":"a cartoon block did that."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-025","slides":[{"text":"there was no streaming."},{"text":"no dvr."},{"text":"you missed it, you missed it."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-026","slides":[{"text":"tom told you to do your homework"},{"text":"and you actually considered it."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-027","slides":[{"text":"outlaw star got one run."},{"text":"people are still talking about it."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-028","slides":[{"text":"the censors removed every gun from gundam wing"},{"text":"except the giant ones on the robots."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-029","slides":[{"text":"someone at school told you what happened"},{"text":"on the episode you missed."},{"text":"they told it wrong."},{"text":"you believed them anyway"},{"text":"and it ruined your whole week."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-030","slides":[{"text":"the music in toonami promos"},{"text":"was better than it needed to be."},{"text":"everything about toonami"},{"text":"was better than it needed to be."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-031","slides":[{"text":"in 1997 cartoon network needed a host"},{"text":"for their new afternoon anime block."},{"text":"they picked moltar from space ghost."},{"text":"voiced by peter cullen."},{"text":"the voice of optimus prime"},{"text":"was introducing dragon ball z to america."},{"text":"nobody at the network thought this was strange."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-032","slides":[{"text":"frieza said five minutes."},{"text":"it was ten episodes."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-033","slides":[{"text":"cartoon network in 1997:"},{"text":"dexter's laboratory at 7 am."},{"text":"cow and chicken at noon."},{"text":"dragon ball z at 4 pm."},{"text":"gundam wing at 5."},{"text":"the real folk blues by 6."},{"text":"one channel did all of that."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-034","slides":[{"text":"you knew the toonami schedule by heart."},{"text":"you didn't know your congressman."},{"text":"priorities were correct."},{"text":"toonertia."}]},{"id":"tn-035","slides":[{"text":"people who say cartoons don't matter"},{"text":"weren't there at 4 pm."},{"text":"toonertia."}]}],"audio":[{"filename":"celadonplaza---271.mp3","title":"271","artist":"Celadonplaza","url":"https://celadonplaza.bandcamp.com/track/--271","license":"by"},{"filename":"celadonplaza---272.mp3","title":"272","artist":"Celadonplaza","url":"https://celadonplaza.bandcamp.com/track/--272","license":"by"},{"filename":"celadonplaza---273.mp3","title":"273","artist":"Celadonplaza","url":"https://celadonplaza.bandcamp.com/track/--273","license":"by"},{"filename":"celadonplaza---276.mp3","title":"276","artist":"Celadonplaza","url":"https://celadonplaza.bandcamp.com/track/--276","license":"by"},{"filename":"steviasphere---22.mp3","title":"22","artist":"Steviasphere","url":"https://steviasphere.bandcamp.com/track/--22","license":"by"},{"filename":"slugweed-livin-life.mp3","title":"Livin Life","artist":"Slugweed","url":"https://slugweed.bandcamp.com/track/livin-life","license":"by"},{"filename":"slugweed-greenvision.mp3","title":"Greenvis